        "$f = x$、$g = x + 1$，$f' = 1$、$g' = 1$。",
        "$f'g - fg' = 1 \\cdot (x + 1) - x \\cdot 1 = 1$。",
        "除以 $g^2 = (x + 1)^2$。"
