    {
      "title": "分子分母都是多項式",
      "prompt": "$\\frac{d}{dx} \\frac{x^2 + 1}{x - 1}$",
      "problemId": "der-038",
      "steps": [
        "$f = x^2 + 1$、$g = x - 1$，$f' = 2x$、$g' = 1$。",
        "$f'g = 2x(x - 1) = 2x^2 - 2x$；$fg' = x^2 + 1$。",
        "相減時括號要整個減：$2x^2 - 2x - (x^2 + 1) = x^2 - 2x - 1$。",
        "除以 $(x - 1)^2$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{x^2 - 2x - 1}{(x - 1)^2}$",
      "claim": "D((x^2+1)/(x-1)) == (x^2-2x-1)/(x-1)^2"
    }
